   "legenda": "Comment “HIRE” and I’ll send you the full guide for building this Grok Bot agent team.\n\nMost people are still using AI like a search bar.\n\nOne prompt in. One answer out. Then they do the rest themselves.\n\nGrok Bot gets more useful when you stop building one giant assistant and start hiring specialists.\n\nThis stack uses three Bots:\n\nThe Research Agent finds the angle, audience pain points, examples, and proof.\n\nThe Copy Agent turns that research into hooks, carousel copy, captions, and CTAs.\n\nThe Distribution Agent packages the final post, adapts it for each platform, and prepares everything for publishing.\n\nEach Bot owns one lane. Each handoff is clear. And the context moves forward without you rebuilding the brief every time.\n\nThat is the real shift.\n\nYou are not asking AI to help with one task.\n\nYou are building a small team that can move an idea from research to finished content.\n\nComment “HIRE” and I’ll send you the exact setup, instructions, prompts, and handoff workflow.\n\nShare this with someone who is still trying to make one AI assistant do every job.\n\n@grok \n\n#grokbot #spacexaipartner #grok #aiagents #aiautomation",
